{"name": "Lost Railway", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A NEW DIMENSION OF CO-OP HORROR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with up to 4 players in the first co-op 2D quota horror. Enjoy a readable side-scrolling space where every jump matters and shadows hide scary threats. Atmospheric visuals meet high-intensity extraction survival gameplay.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/0458e560643a928a30c0d9e639f1451f.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/0458e560643a928a30c0d9e639f1451f.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/0458e560643a928a30c0d9e639f1451f.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LOOT YOUR WAY OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge abandoned stations, grab everything worth carrying, and make it back alive. Every run is a desperate trip for loot, tools, and resources your train needs to keep moving.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/38580de188e9e82c7344e67f095d603f.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/38580de188e9e82c7344e67f095d603f.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/38580de188e9e82c7344e67f095d603f.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADORABLE HEROES IN A HORRIFIC WORLD </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as cute yet resilient animal survivors in a world full of terrifying monsters, blood, and dismemberment. Charming on the surface, nasty underneath.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/bf4a689357eb896c08b23457253503e3.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/bf4a689357eb896c08b23457253503e3.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/bf4a689357eb896c08b23457253503e3.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IF IT BLEEDS, YOU CAN KILL IT... OR CAN YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight off common enemies and elite monsters with scavenged weapons. Each biome is a hunting ground for an immortal boss. These horrors cannot be killed. You must learn their behaviour to survive. Some battles are won by running.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/f74d25f5775a85de1880965b0919c780.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/f74d25f5775a85de1880965b0919c780.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/f74d25f5775a85de1880965b0919c780.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIGH RISK, HIGH REWARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources are never extra. Your squad always needs them, but to get them you must dive deeper into the bunkers. Time is of the essence and levels become more dangerous with every minute. Risk it all and sacrifice your friends for more loot or choose safe option and bail out as quickly as possible - but how will your train go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/7d8868360b709bfa5ff6e0165a7f92ea.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/7d8868360b709bfa5ff6e0165a7f92ea.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/7d8868360b709bfa5ff6e0165a7f92ea.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRAIN MUST MOVE FORWARD</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever the price, the train must always move forward. Your task is simple - find enough resources to keep it moving. It is your shelter, yes, but make sure this insatiable machine keeps rolling further into the ruins.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/4aab773e7c74c49a6df5158c6689a0e1.poster.avif?t=1782136904\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/4aab773e7c74c49a6df5158c6689a0e1.webm?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/extras/4aab773e7c74c49a6df5158c6689a0e1.mp4?t=1782136904\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A co-op 2D quota horror game with cute animals and terrifying monsters. Assemble a team of up to 4 players and venture into the depths of the nightmare for valuable loot, tools and secrets. Because the train must always move forward!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862750/8c8d178e2f9af5a80d21beb84f4f04ce5874ab99/header.jpg?t=1782136904", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Co-op", "Action", "Action Roguelike", "Indie", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Crossbridge Game Studios", "publishers": "Crossbridge Game Studios", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "862750", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uZX-JzylUMI", "first_seen": 1775685600.0, "review_rank": 866}